.TH geectl-service-state 1  "geectl-service-state 0.2.3" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-service\-state \- Show the last service run state of a package
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl service state\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> <\fIPACKAGE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the last service run state of a package
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project the package lives in
.TP
<\fIPACKAGE\fR>
The package to show the service state of
.SH VERSION
v0.2.3
